<title>HONG KONG: San Miguel HK declares HK$0.04 1st div.</title>
<headline>San Miguel HK declares HK$0.04 1st div.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>For year ending Dec 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 San Miguel Brewery Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 25</p>
<p>NOTE - San Miguel Brewery, a subsidiary of San Miguel Corp of the Philippines, is a beer producer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
